# ============================================================
# GPX4 / Puncta analysis
#
#
# Statistical workflow:
#   1. Calculate one mean per Treatment x Replicate
#   2. Fit lm(Value ~ Treatment)
#   3. Test normality of model residuals
#   4. If residuals are approximately normal:
#        -> one-way ANOVA
#        -> Tukey-adjusted pairwise comparisons
#   5. If residuals are non-normal:
#        -> Kruskal-Wallis
#        -> Dunn test with Holm adjustment
#
# Statistical tests are performed on the raw replicate means.
# Plots are normalized to RPMI-control within each replicate.
# ============================================================


# ============================================================
# 1. PACKAGES
# ============================================================

